    "next_step": "Run a small matched self-play PPO smoke from the exact Standard10 source: control uses zero-update frozen bridge reference and treatment uses v6legacyv4obs with sampled PPO under the same physical rules. Require accounting/session audit, exact deployability, and bounded source-state drift before scaling."
